      "line": 19,
      "text": "3 术语和定义",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L19"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "下列术语和定义适用于本文件。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "困难立地  difficult habitat",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "指干旱贫瘠土地、盐碱地、重金属污染土地等造林难度较大的立地。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "干旱贫瘠土地  arid and barren land",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "年降雨量小于1500 mm，土壤养分含量不足的土地，主要分布于粤北和粤西地区。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "盐碱地  saline and alkali land",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "沿海地势低平，导致海水倒灌或因气温高，蒸发量大使土壤水分中盐分升高，造成土壤的次生盐渍",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "化形成的滨海盐土，主要分布在湛江、珠海、江门、茂名等市的海岸沿线。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "重金属污染土地  heavy metal contaminated land",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 33,
      "text": "因重金属在土壤中过量沉积而引起污染的土地，主要分布于珠三角和粤北地区。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L33"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 34,
      "text": "4 树种选择",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L34"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 35,
      "text": "选择原则",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P5:L35"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2506—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L1"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 3,
      "text": "依据立地条件和特点选择主要造林树种，做到适地适树适种源。多树种搭配造林、较强生态治理功",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L3"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 4,
      "text": "能和兼具一定经济效益原则。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L4"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "适宜的主要树种",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 6,
      "text": "各类土地适宜主要树种为：",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L6"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 7,
      "text": "a) 干旱贫瘠土地适宜树种为赤桉(E. camaldulensis)、柠檬桉(E. citriodora)。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L7"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 8,
      "text": "b) 盐碱地适宜树种为赤桉(E. camaldulensis)、窿缘桉(E. exserta)。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L8"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 9,
      "text": "c) 重金属污染土地适宜树种为赤桉(E. camaldulensis)、柠檬桉(E. citriodora)。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L9"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 10,
      "text": "各立地类型主要造林树种及技术参数参见附录A。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L10"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 11,
      "text": "5 整地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L11"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 12,
      "text": "原则",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L12"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "根据不同立地类型灵活整地，禁止采用炼山、全面深挖整地的方式，防止水土流失。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "方法",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 15,
      "text": "5.2.1 干旱贫瘠土地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L15"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 16,
      "text": "采用鱼鳞坑整地或集水整地，按GB/T 15776执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L16"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 17,
      "text": "5.2.2 盐碱地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L17"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 18,
      "text": "整地宜早不宜迟，整地后借雨水淋洗和人工冲洗盐分：",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L18"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 19,
      "text": "a) 轻度盐碱地：可直接进行穴状整地，按GB/T 15776 执行；",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L19"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "b) 中度盐碱地：采用挖排盐渠，铺上厚20 cm 碎石、炉渣、碎矸石等形成隔淋层。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 21,
      "text": "种植穴规格50 cm×30 cm×40 cm（上表×深×底部）。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L21"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "5.2.3 重金属污染土地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "结合当地林地的实际情况采用整地措施：",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 24,
      "text": "a) 地势较平的污染土地：穴状整地。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L24"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "b) 需要蓄水保土的干旱坡地或沙砾石质土地：鱼鳞坑整地。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "种植穴规格60 cm×40 cm×40 cm（上表×深×底部）。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 27,
      "text": "6 土壤改良",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L27"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "干旱贫瘠土地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "造林前施用抗旱保水剂，保水剂采用聚丙烯酸钾盐类高分子吸水材料，浓度为40 g/株，浸泡时间",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "为30 min。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 31,
      "text": "盐碱地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L31"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "造林前，应根据测定的土壤盐碱度确定改良造林地土壤，施用沸石、黄铁矿渣及土壤盐分拮抗剂及",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 33,
      "text": "螯合剂等，以降低盐分。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L33"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 34,
      "text": "重金属污染土地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P6:L34"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2506—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L1"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "3",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 3,
      "text": "施用重金属污染钝化剂后造林。每公顷施用3 000 kg～6 000 kg。对于矿区和化工厂区高污染土",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L3"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 4,
      "text": "壤，每公顷施用15 000 kg～30 000 kg。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L4"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "7 造林密度",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 6,
      "text": "根据立地条件和培育目标确定造林密度。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L6"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 7,
      "text": "a) 干旱贫瘠土地造林密度一般不超过900 株/hm2，以4.0 m×3.0 m 为宜。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L7"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 8,
      "text": "b) 盐碱地造林密度一般不超过1666 株/hm2，以2.0 m×3.0 m 为宜。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L8"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 9,
      "text": "c) 重金属污染土地造林密度一般不超过2500 株/hm2，以2.0 m×2.0 m 为宜。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L9"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 10,
      "text": "8 基肥施放",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L10"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 11,
      "text": "基肥在栽植前施入，采用充分腐熟的有机肥或桉树专用基肥500 g/穴。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L11"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 12,
      "text": "9 栽植",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L12"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "苗木质量",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "执行GB 6000规定，使用质量Ⅱ级以上苗木。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 15,
      "text": "时间",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L15"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 16,
      "text": "以雨季造林为宜。雨后土壤湿润深度达30 cm时栽植。土壤需要改良的先改良后造林。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L16"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 17,
      "text": "造林",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L17"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 18,
      "text": "为保证造林成活率，苗木运输过程中要遮荫，避免日晒和苗木失水。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L18"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 19,
      "text": "a) 干旱贫瘠土地造林时浇足定根水。造林后在苗木周围铺设地膜、覆盖秸秆等措施，抑制土壤水",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L19"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "分蒸发，保持土壤水分。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 21,
      "text": "b) 盐碱地造林要平穴浅栽，造林后的穴面与周围地面相平，植苗后灌水2 次～3 次，降低苗木周",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L21"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "围的盐分，浇水后及时松土防止土壤板结。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "c) 重金属污染土地用高穴浅栽。种植穴挖好后在穴内覆客土10 cm，培紧踩实。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 24,
      "text": "d) 造林后3 个月内，检查造林成活率，不成活的，及时补植。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L24"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "10 抚育管理",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "松土除草",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 27,
      "text": "松土结合除草进行。造林后1 a～3 a，每年抚育1次～2次，包括松土、除草、疏通排水沟。除去苗",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L27"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "木周边半径100 cm内的杂灌杂草和藤蔓。松土时里浅外深，不伤害苗木根系，以植株为中心，将半径50",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "cm内的土壤铲松，深度10 cm～15 cm。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "抗旱",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 31,
      "text": "造林后可根据苗木生长状况、降雨量、土壤墒情等及时浇水。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L31"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "追肥",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P7:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2506—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L1"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "4",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 3,
      "text": "10.3.1 时间",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L3"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 4,
      "text": "造林后追肥3次，第1次为当年定植后3个月，第2～第3次分别于造林后第2～3年的雨季来临前追肥",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L4"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "（4月～5月）。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 6,
      "text": "10.3.2 肥量",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L6"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 7,
      "text": "造林后，连续三年追施加入微生物菌剂的有机无机复混肥，每次追肥量500 g/株～750 g /株，复",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L7"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 8,
      "text": "混肥微生物及养分含量执行DB44/T 1401规定。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L8"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 9,
      "text": "10.3.3 方法",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L9"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 10,
      "text": "按DB44/T 900执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L10"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 11,
      "text": "11 有害生物防治",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L11"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 12,
      "text": "按LY/T 2456执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L12"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "12 建档",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "执行GB/T 15781规定，建立生产经营档案，配置档案管护设施设备，专人保管。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P8:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2506—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L1"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "5",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 3,
      "text": "A",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L3"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "A",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
