      "text": "（资料性）",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L9"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 10,
      "text": "困难立地桉树造林主要树种及技术参数表",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L10"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 11,
      "text": "树种",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L11"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 12,
      "text": "（拉丁学名）",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L12"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "树种特性",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "适宜气候",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 15,
      "text": "适生立地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L15"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 16,
      "text": "赤桉",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L16"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Eucalyptus camaldulensis",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L17"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 18,
      "text": "对酸性，微碱性土，以及较瘦薄的砾质沙壤土均能",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L18"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 19,
      "text": "适应。在pH值8.5的碱性土上，生长良好。根系发",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L19"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "达，适应性强，既耐干旱，又耐水湿，既耐寒冷，",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 21,
      "text": "又耐炎热，抗风力强。极端低温-9℃时，一般不受",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L21"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "冻害。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "热带和亚热带",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 24,
      "text": "季风气候",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L24"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "干旱贫瘠土地、盐",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "碱地、重金属污染",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 27,
      "text": "土地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L27"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "窿缘桉",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "E. exserta",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "对土壤的要求不严，适生于酸性（pH4.5-6）的红",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 31,
      "text": "壤、砖红壤性红黄色土、砖红壤性红色土、或深厚",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L31"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "的冲积土，滨海粗、中沙土亦能生长，且能耐盐",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 33,
      "text": "碱。在土层深厚、排水良好的地方，生长良好。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L33"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 34,
      "text": "热带海洋性季",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L34"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 35,
      "text": "风气候",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L35"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 36,
      "text": "盐碱地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L36"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 37,
      "text": "柠檬桉",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L37"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 38,
      "text": "E. citriodora",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L38"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 39,
      "text": "喜光和热，适生于年平均气温18℃以上，绝对最低",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L39"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 40,
      "text": "气温0℃以上，全年无霜或基本无霜；对土壤要求不",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L40"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 41,
      "text": "严，耐干旱贫瘠。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf:P9:L41"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2506-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 42,
